- op: discuss  # 64f7
  at: '2026-04-26T08:49:09Z'  # 64f7
  by: agent  # 64f7
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 64f7
  clock: 3  # 64f7
  nonce: 64f7  # 64f7
  message: "Fixed in PR #3398 (commit 5655bf501). Two producers updated: (1) manifest_targets._emit moved target_path from edge.dst to edge.meta['target_path'] and constructs a 5-part dst id ({language}:{target_path}:0-0:{name}:unresolved) — language slot is the existing per-extractor meta-language (gradle/csproj/swift/sbt/etc.). (2) bash sources edges similarly use 5-part bash:{sourced_path}:0-0:{basename}:file with sourced_path on edge.meta. Updated 18 existing test assertions to query edge.meta.get('target_path') as the canonical location, plus added TestDefinesTargetDstShape and a bash sources shape test. Cohort verification: kafka's 34 manifest leaks + 8 bash sources leaks (42 total invalid-language nodes) will drop to 0 once the next cohort re-runs."  # 64f7
